  {
    "_index": 169,
    "Id": "AsyncTradeStashPanelHelpPopup",
    "Text": "<valuedefault>{In order to sell items using this system you need to have a Merchant's Tab}\r\n\r\n<cxinfocolour>{How to get a Merchant's Tab:}\r\n<valuedefault>{Premium Stash Tabs bought before 30th August 2025 can be converted to Merchant's Tabs for free.\r\nStash Tab conversion can only be done through the Website.\r\nNOTE: After conversion your chosen Premium Tabs will be gone from your personal Stash as it will now be a Merchant's Tab.  \r\nYou can buy a Merchant's Tab in the Microtransaction Shop.}\r\n\r\n<cxinfocolour>{As a Seller:}\r\n<valuedefault>{To list an item for sale, place the item in one of the Shop tabs and set a price.\r\nYou can't reprice an item for a duration once it has been \"Secured\" by someone coming to get it.\r\nAn item's gold fee is assigned by the system.\r\nBuyers will be teleported to your hideout to buy the item from your Merchant's Tab.\r\nYou'll receive a notification when a trade has been completed.\r\nThe currency from your sales can be collected from the Earnings tab.\r\nYou can view the last 100 sales by clicking the Sales History button.}\r\n<default>{You can} <valuedefault>{Right-Click} <default>{the tab to rename and recolour it.}\r\n\r\n<cxinfocolour>{As a Buyer:}\r\n<valuedefault>{Find \"Securable\" Listings on the Market Panel or the Trade Website.\r\nSecuring the item will teleport your character to the Seller's hideout.\r\nBuy the item from the Seller's Merchant's Tab.}\r\n<default>{You can} <valuedefault>{Right-Click} <default>{the Seller's tab to report it for inappropriate naming.}"
  },
