  {
    "_index": 256,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueBelt",
    "Text": "Hold fast the tiller, my good friend."
  },
  {
    "_index": 257,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueJewel",
    "Text": "Shine on, my sweet. "
  },
  {
    "_index": 258,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueRing",
    "Text": "I wanted his ring. He wouldn't yield it... so I took his finger too."
  },
  {
    "_index": 259,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueAmulet",
    "Text": "Be this blessing or millstone, it is now yours to wear."
  },
  {
    "_index": 260,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueFlask",
    "Text": "Drink deep from the wellspring of life."
  },
  {
    "_index": 261,
    "Id": "BottledHinekorasLock",
    "Text": "May your course be straight and your heart be true."
  },
  {
    "_index": 262,
    "Id": "BottledFracturingOrb",
    "Text": "For those seeking surety in a chaotic world."
  },
  {
    "_index": 263,
    "Id": "BottledDivineOrb",
    "Text": "May this bring you better fortune than it did me."
  },
  {
    "_index": 264,
    "Id": "BottledDivineOrbStack",
    "Text": "This plunder brought me no end of trouble. I return it to the sea."
  },
  {
    "_index": 265,
    "Id": "BottledReflectingMist",
    "Text": "Remember this well: the mist reflects all. But reflection is not truth."
  },
  {
    "_index": 266,
    "Id": "BottledStackedDeckStack",
    "Text": "My collecting days are done. Yours are just beginning. "
  },
  {
    "_index": 267,
    "Id": "BottledBrokenMirror",
    "Text": "Had enough bad luck for one lifetime."
  },
  {
    "_index": 268,
    "Id": "BottledAlbinoCrabClaw",
    "Text": "'Pinched' this one a while back. Had nothing but misery ever since."
  },
  {
    "_index": 269,
    "Id": "BottledChainHookOfAngling",
    "Text": "Should your foe feel an ocean away... they shan't be for long."
  },
  {
    "_index": 270,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueKalandrasTouch",
    "Text": "Stare deep into the mirror. Do not turn from what you see."
  },
  {
    "_index": 271,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueReplicaDragonfangsFlight",
    "Text": "Gave this to my beloved. She claimed it was a fake."
  },
  {
    "_index": 272,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueDefianceOfDestiny",
    "Text": "In the darkest of hours, may this serve as a reminder: your fate is yours to forge."
  },
  {
    "_index": 273,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueRyslathasCoil",
    "Text": "To whosoever receives this: you are now another of Ryslatha's children."
  },
  {
    "_index": 274,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueHeadhunter",
    "Text": "My strength grew with every kill... but so too did the bounty on my head. "
  },
  {
    "_index": 275,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueMageblood",
    "Text": "Reader beware: to don this is to be the envy of all. I prefer anonymity."
  },
  {
    "_index": 276,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueInspiredLearning",
    "Text": "May your enemies' greatest strength become their fatal flaw."
  },
  {
    "_index": 277,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueUnnaturalInstinct",
    "Text": "Most learn to trust their instincts. I learned not to."
  },
  {
    "_index": 278,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueBloodnotch",
    "Text": "A word of advice: let them think they have the advantage. Makes them easier to kill."
  },
  {
    "_index": 279,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueTasteOfHate",
    "Text": "For when the ocean wind bites with salt-speckled teeth, may this keep you warm."
  },
  {
    "_index": 280,
    "Id": "BottledUniqueRainOfSplinters",
    "Text": "Kaom swore he'd hunt me down. I'd rather not have this when he does."
  },
